{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q408163","formula":"C₁₀H₇Cl₂N₃O","hill":"C10H7Cl2N3O","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":7.0,"N":3.0,"O":1.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Anagrelide","ru":"Анагрелид","uk":"Анагрелід"},"descriptions":{"en":"Anagrelide (Agrylin/Xagrid, Shire and Thromboreductin, AOP Orphan Pharmaceuticals AG) is a drug used for the treatment of essential thrombocytosis (also known as essential thrombocythemia), or overproduction of blood platelets. It has also been used in the treatment of chronic myeloid leukemia. Anagrelide controlled release (GALE-401) is in phase III clinical trials by Galena Biopharma for the treatment of essential thrombocytosis.","ru":"Анагрелид, (Anagrelide), агрилин, производное имидазохиназолина, лекарственный препарат, используемый при увеличении количества тромбоцитов в крови (эссенциальный тромбоцитоз, истинная полицитемия и другие).","uk":"Анагрелід (лат. Anagrelidum, англ. Anagrelide) — синтетичний лікарський препарат, що належить до групи інгібіторів фосфодіестерази, який застосовується перорально."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":135409400,"mass":256.08,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C2=C(C=CC(=C2Cl)Cl)N=C3N1CC(=O)N3","inchikey":"OTBXOEAOVRKTNQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"6,7-dichloro-3,5-dihydro-1H-imidazo[2,1-b]quinazolin-2-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"135409400","atoms":23,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.311,"y":-1.283,"z":-0.219,"el":"C"},{"x":0.983,"y":-0.506,"z":-0.115,"el":"C"},{"x":0.924,"y":0.882,"z":0.142,"el":"C"},{"x":2.106,"y":1.617,"z":0.265,"el":"C"},{"x":3.347,"y":0.994,"z":0.142,"el":"C"},{"x":3.416,"y":-0.38,"z":-0.095,"el":"C"},{"x":2.239,"y":-1.136,"z":-0.218,"el":"C"},{"x":2.319,"y":-2.851,"z":-0.479,"el":"Cl"},{"x":4.991,"y":-1.083,"z":-0.22,"el":"